                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does Pongal + Sankranti drive for South India D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>15-25% of annual regional South India revenue. Peak South Indian festival season.</p>
                                        <h3>Should national brands do Pongal + Sankranti?</h3>
                                        <p>For brands with South India presence: yes with regional-specific creative + language + content. 5-10% of annual budget.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest Pongal + Sankranti mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Hindi-only content + no regional adaptation. South India requires regional-language + cultural + creator adaptation.</p>
                                        <h3>Is Sankranti a national or regional festival?</h3>
                                        <p>Both — Makar Sankranti national but regional variations (Pongal Tamil + Uttarayan Gujarat + Lohri Punjab + Bihu Assam). Regional adaptation essential.</p>
